Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:27.62,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡A UN PÍXEL DEL LOBO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dime que no te...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dime que no te mata, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me voy a encabronar si te\Nmata.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Congélate, congélate,\Ncongélate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:07.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Wey, me está siguiendo,\Nhijo de la chingada, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:08.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Ay, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Lo tienes viniendo atrás,\Nwey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No mames, cabrón!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No pares, no pares, no\Npares, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Lo tienes a un píxel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:16.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Lo tienes a un píxel,\Ncabrón!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:17.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ay, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ay, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Lo tienes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Uf, por fin, wey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Sí, lo tenías a un píxel,\Ncabrón.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te lo juro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Si frenabas un segundo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}te mataba, wey.
